      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Punjabi is an Indo-Aryan language spoken by over 100 million native speakers worldwide. It is the native language of the Punjabi people in India and Pakistan. Punjabi is written in both the Shahmukhi and the Gurmukhi scripts.</skos:definition>
