      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Laycock cites a published study that shows that the wordlist the existence of the language is based on was not reliable--collected monolingually by a government patrol officer. Glottolog concurs with this merger and has already decommissioned this language. [Bikaru is therefore Merged into Bisorio (bir).]</skos:scopeNote>
      <at:end.use>2021-01-15</at:end.use>
