      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">So now, almost 25 years later, based on years of working in this region we are convinced that there are indeed two distinct, but related, Gondi languages [Aheri Gondi, esg and Adilabad Gondi, wsg].</skos:scopeNote>
