         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The name Mina designates a caste name and a tribe name in India. Ethnologue reports that the Mina" use a mix of Dhundari [dhd], Mewari [mtr], and Mewati [wtm]" and "reportedly L1 is Dhundari [dhd] in Rajasthjan and Braj Bhasha [bra] in Madhya Pradesh."</skos:scopeNote>
      <at:end.use>2019-01-25</at:end.use>
   </skos:Concept>
