      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The name Karipúna (Karipuna do Amapá) generally refers to a variant of Palikúr [plu] in earlier references (Gallois and Ricardo 1983). A short word list attests to the fact that Karipúna is a Palikúr variety (Loukotka 1963).</skos:scopeNote>
      <at:end.use>2023-01-20</at:end.use>
   </skos:Concept>
