      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Yotti is listed as a dialect of Yendang. This was a mistake, as they are linguistically and socially distinct. Thus, Yendang [yen] split into Yendang [ynq] and Yotti [yot]</skos:scopeNote>
