      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Kakauhua [kbf] is listed as an extinct Kaweskaran language. However, there is no data pertaining to the alleged language of this ethnonym, and it cannot be asserted that such a language ever existed as a separate language</skos:scopeNote>
