         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">In this present request, we observe that previous linguistic data were acquired for a variety of Kaure spoken near the Narau river, hence the name. Dommel and Dommel (1991) report that Narau and Kaure are mutually intelligible,</skos:scopeNote>
