      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Glottolog lists Chamari as "unattested". Hammarstrom (2015) states that the Chamari [cdg] entry describes the Chamaar caste, but the Chamari do not have a language of their own, citing Russell and Hiralal 1916.</skos:scopeNote>
