         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Laarim (Larim, Longarim) or Narim is a Surmic language spoken by the Laarim people of the Laarim Hills of South Sudan. It has been proposed that Surmic languages are part of the putative Nilo-Saharan language family.</skos:definition>
