      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Tagin &amp; Sulung tribes of Arunachal: A sociolinguistic survey, NLCI 2007 says that Tagin [tgj] nand Nisi [njz] are two different languages. Nisi language shows 54-60% of lexical similarity with Tagin.</skos:scopeNote>
