         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Bengkala Sign Language is a sign language used in Bengkala and Kata Kolok villages in Bali. Sign languages are languages which mainly use signs made with the hands, the arms or the body and facial expressions.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
