         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Ho Chi Minh City Sign Language is a sign language used in Ho Chi Minh City in Viet Nam. Sign languages are languages which mainly use signs made with the hands, the arms or the body and facial expressions.</skos:definition>
