      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Czech Sign Language is a sign language used in the Czech Republic. Sign languages are languages which mainly use signs made with the hands, the arms or the body and facial expressions.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
