      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Northern Tasmanian, or Tommeginne, is an Aboriginal language of Tasmania in the reconstruction of Claire Bowern. Northern Tasmanian is attested from word lists collected on Flinders Island by Joseph Milligan and published in 1857 &amp; 1859.</skos:definition>
