      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">This code is deprecated in ISO 639-3. It is no longer in active use, but still has the meaning assigned to it when it was established in the Standard.</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Linguistic/Ethnic Identity: The ethnic and linguistic identity of people in both groups (Yamphe [yma] and Southern Lorung [lrr]) is 'Yamphu.' Thus, Yamphe [yma] merge into Southern Lorung [lrr].</skos:scopeNote>
