      <at:op-mapped-code>
         <at:MappedCode>
            <dc:source>iso-639-3</dc:source>
            <at:legacy-code>duj</at:legacy-code>
         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">https://iso639-3.sil.org/code_tables/deprecated_codes/data</skos:historyNote>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Dhuwaya has been identified as a Koine or 'communilect' of the Yirrkala community, and the author of the most comprehensive description of the language. It also does not fit the clan/family classification of other Dhuwal languages. Removing Dhuwaya from the existing classification of Dhuwal requires a reassignation of the code for Dhuwal varieties [dwu and dwy].</skos:scopeNote>
      <at:end.use>2016-01-15</at:end.use>
   </skos:Concept>
