      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">All three villages said that that they spoke Koro. Papitalai villagers specifically mentioned there was not a "Papitalai" language that was different from Koro [kxr].</skos:scopeNote>
      <at:end.use>2021-01-15</at:end.use>
   </skos:Concept>
