         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Kenyan Sign Language is a sign language used in Kenya. Sign languages are languages which mainly use signs made with the hands, the arms or the body and facial expressions.</skos:definition>
